<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>All Posts - Fulur</title><link>http://example.org/posts/</link><description>All Posts | Fulur</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 13:04:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://example.org/posts/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MQ:四大主流消息队列对比分析与选型建议（Kafka、RocketMQ、RabbitMQ、ActiveMQ）</title><link>http://example.org/posts/middle_ware/mq/%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 13:04:52 +0800</pubDate><author>fulu</author><guid>http://example.org/posts/middle_ware/mq/%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE/</guid><description>&lt;p>在分布式系统架构中，消息队列（Message Queue, MQ）扮演着解耦、削峰填谷、异步通信的关键角色。常见的MQ包括 Apache Kafka、Apache RocketMQ、RabbitMQ 和 Apache ActiveMQ。每种 MQ 有不同的技术背景、设计目标与应用场景，本文结合官网资料、社区经验与典型实践，深入剖析四者异同，帮助工程师做出科学选型。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Spring：SpringBoot 核心原理剖析与实战：从启动流程到自动装配</title><link>http://example.org/posts/java/spring/springboot-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Apr 2025 17:52:52 +0800</pubDate><author>fulu</author><guid>http://example.org/posts/java/spring/springboot-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="一为什么要掌握-springboot-核心原理">一、为什么要掌握 SpringBoot 核心原理？</h2>
